Astribot EE34 Toolkit

This project was developed from an Astribot S1 data-conversion and kinematics
audit workflow originally maintained alongside OpenPI. It is distributed as an
independent toolkit and does not include OpenPI source code, Astribot SDK files,
URDF files, meshes, or datasets.

Astribot SDK and model assets are distributed separately under their respective
license terms. Retain their copyright and license notices when redistributing
those assets.
